/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=31536000,immutable

# Narration audio.
#
# SA-098: /audio/* is NO LONGER served from this bundle. `strip-audio-from-assets`
# removes the tracks before deploy and `src/app/audio/[file]/route.ts` serves them
# from R2, because Cloudflare's static-asset layer does not implement 206 Partial
# Content — a Range request came back 200 with the whole body, so every scrub in a
# 20-minute reading refetched all of it. The route sets its own headers, including
# a truthful `Accept-Ranges`.
#
# The rule below is kept only for the labelled asset fallback in that route, and
# for local `next dev`. An earlier comment here claimed Cloudflare satisfies Range
# by slicing its own cached copy; that was measured false on 2026-08-19.
/audio/*
  Cache-Control: public,max-age=31536000,immutable
  Accept-Ranges: bytes
